1
00:00:00,485 --> 00:00:02,275
(Penny:)Sheldon, would you like to come in?

2
00:00:02,446 --> 00:00:04,946
(Sheldon:)I suppose I could spare a few minutes.

3
00:00:07,743 --> 00:00:08,783
[SHELDON GASPS]

4
00:00:08,952 --> 00:00:11,042
(Sheldon:)Were you robbed?

5
00:00:12,748 --> 00:00:14,378
(Sheldon:)No.

6
00:00:14,541 --> 00:00:16,881
(Sheldon:)How can you be sure?

7
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:18,424
(Penny:)Sheldon, what do you want?

8
00:00:18,587 --> 00:00:21,047
(Sheldon:)I'm certain this will come
as no surprise to you.

9
00:00:21,214 --> 00:00:25,764
- Leonard is failing in another relationship.
- He's having problems with Stephanie?

10
00:00:25,927 --> 00:00:29,267
(Sheldon:)She's sending virtual livestock
to random men on the Internet.

11
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:32,683
(Sheldon:)If I have any hope
of keeping them together, I need data.

12
00:00:32,851 --> 00:00:36,231
(Sheldon:)Specifically, I need to know exactly
what Leonard did that caused you...

13
00:00:36,396 --> 00:00:39,436
(Sheldon:)...to pop an emotional cap
in his buttocks.

14
00:00:41,652 --> 00:00:43,732
(Penny:)- What?
- Again, urban slang.

15
00:00:43,904 --> 00:00:47,114
(Sheldon:)In which I believe
I'm gaining remarkable fluency.

16
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,330
(Sheldon:)So, what is the down and the low?

17
00:00:50,494 --> 00:00:52,744
(Sheldon:)And don't worry,
this is all entirely confidential...

18
00:00:52,913 --> 00:00:56,293
(Sheldon:)...so you feel free to include any
and all shortcomings in the bedroom.

